stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> STARTED
    STARTED --> STOCK_RESERVED: StockReserved
    STARTED --> COMPENSATING: StockRejected
    STOCK_RESERVED --> PAYMENT_APPROVED: PaymentApproved
    STOCK_RESERVED --> COMPENSATING: PaymentRefused / timeout
    PAYMENT_APPROVED --> COMPLETED: OrderApproved
    PAYMENT_APPROVED --> COMPENSATING: falha ao aprovar pedido (RefundPayment)
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATED: compensações concluídas
    COMPENSATING --> FAILED: retries esgotados (intervenção manual)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    COMPENSATED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
